    "rule": "Dark is a lightness ladder, darkest first: app < room canvas (the thread) < canvas-default (panels, card bodies, menus, modals, deep panels) < canvas-raised (card title rows, deep-detail head, tool-card summary) < subtle-secondary (tracks, disabled fields). In dark, subtle-primary == canvas-raised by design. In light the order inverts for panels: white is the top rung.",
    "turnCard": "title row = canvas-raised; expanded body + deep panel = canvas-default (one rung down, same as .mj_ToolCard summary/body)"
  },
